window.docContents[154].resolve({"/Attributes/#scoped-attributes":{"contents":"许多属性可以应用于特定作用域。\n这决定了属性的效果是仅在当前小节作用域中可见、在打开当前命名空间的作用域内可见，还是处处可见。\n这些作用域指示也用于控制语法扩展和类型类实例。\n每个属性都负责精确定义这些术语对其特定效果意味着什么。\n\n属性作用域具有全局作用域的声明（默认情形）会在建立它们的模块被传递导入时生效。\n不写其他作用域修饰符即表示全局作用域。具有局部作用域的声明只在建立它们的小节作用域范围内生效。具有命名空间作用域的声明会在建立它们的命名空间被打开时生效。\n\n","context":"Lean 中文参考手册\u0009属性","header":"9.3. 有作用域的属性","id":"/Attributes/#scoped-attributes"},"/Basic-Types/Byte-Arrays/#ByteArray":{"contents":"Byte arrays are a specialized array type that can only contain elements of type UInt8.\nDue to this restriction, they can use a much more efficient representation, with no pointer indirections.\nLike other arrays, byte arrays are represented in compiled code as dynamic arrays, and the Lean runtime specially optimizes array operations.\nThe operations that modify byte arrays first check the array's reference count, and if there are no other references to the array, it is modified in place.\n\nThere is no literal syntax for byte arrays.\nList.toByteArray can be used to construct an array from a list literal.\n\nByteArray is like Array UInt8, but with an efficient run-time representation as a packed\nbyte buffer.Packs an array of bytes into a ByteArray.Converting between Array and ByteArray takes linear time.The data contained in the byte array.Converting between Array and ByteArray takes linear time.\n\n\n\n","context":"Lean 中文参考手册\u0009Basic Types","header":"20.17. Byte Arrays","id":"/Basic-Types/Byte-Arrays/#ByteArray"},"/releases/v4.26.0/#The-Lean-Language-Reference--Release-Notes--Lean-4___26___0-_LPAR_2025-12-13_RPAR_--Highlights--Breaking-Changes":{"contents":"* #10625 通过从参数列表和结构中擦除 IO.RealWorld 参数，实现了零成本 BaseIO。这对外部函数接口（FFI）是一项重大破坏性变更。\n\n","context":"Lean 中文参考手册\u0009发行说明\u0009Lean 4.26.0 (2025-12-13)\u0009亮点","header":"破坏性变更","id":"/releases/v4.26.0/#The-Lean-Language-Reference--Release-Notes--Lean-4___26___0-_LPAR_2025-12-13_RPAR_--Highlights--Breaking-Changes"},"/releases/v4.31.0/#The-Lean-Language-Reference--Release-Notes--Lean-4___31___0-_LPAR_2026-06-13_RPAR_--Highlights--Library-Highlights":{"contents":"上一个版本引入的标准 HTTP 库成长为工作服务器：#12146 添加了 H1 纯 HTTP/1.1 状态机，#12151 添加了异步 HTTP/1.1 Server。重要的是，#13511 将 Async 和 Http 模块从 Internal 升级到 Std。\n\n其他值得注意的库添加：\n\n* 日期/时间获得本地时间点的 WallTime 类型和简化的 Timestamp 接口 (#13675)，以及用于可配置格式的 Locale/LocaleSymbols (#13567)。* List.prod/Array.prod/Vector.prod 镜像现有的 sum 接口，具有简化和磨削引理 (#13200)。* 更多 ByteArray push/set! 引理 (#13457) 和 Vector 附加引理推广到不同大小的向量 (#13693)。* 验证 String.dropWhile/String.takeWhile 继续字符串验证工作 (#13155)。\n\n许多运行时稳健性修复还将以前无声的内存耗尽故障转变为正确的错误或崩溃，而不是段错误和损坏（#13392、#13546、#13547、#13548、#13549、#13521）。对于安全敏感的部署，#13401 添加了 LEAN_MI_SECURE 构建选项，可实现额外的 mimalloc 内存安全缓解。\n\n","context":"Lean 中文参考手册\u0009发行说明\u0009Lean4.31.0 (2026-06-13)\u0009亮点","header":"库亮点","id":"/releases/v4.31.0/#The-Lean-Language-Reference--Release-Notes--Lean-4___31___0-_LPAR_2026-06-13_RPAR_--Highlights--Library-Highlights"}});